# drained-events-archive

This file lists archived post_tool review events.

Each line is a JSON object written by `~/.jcode/bin/jcode-post-tool-review-queue`
when a `write|edit|apply_patch|multiedit` tool call succeeded in a watched cwd.

The coordinator's `~/.jcode/bin/jcode-drain-review-queue` rotates pending
events into timestamped files under `archive/` and prints a JSON dump so
the coordinator agent (this jcode session) can forward it to advisor swarm
subagents via `swarm dm`. Archives are kept for audit/forensics; old ones
can be pruned manually.

See also `~/.jcode/scripts/resource-sentry.sh` for the disk/memory watchdog.
